@startuml Analytics_DatabaseDiagram
!include style.iuml
skinparam linetype ortho
title MindFlow - Analytics & Reporting - Database Diagram (no tables of its own)

package "Read by Analytics (owned by Journal and Habits & Wellness)" {
  entity "journal_entries" as journal_entries {
    * id : int <<PK>>
    --
    * user_id : int
    * date : datetime(6)
    * sentiment : longtext
    * category : longtext
    * title : longtext
    deleted_at : datetime, nullable
  }
  entity "habits" as habits {
    * id : int <<PK>>
    --
    * user_id : int
    * status : varchar(20)
    deleted_at : datetime, nullable
  }
  entity "habit_completion_logs" as habit_completion_logs {
    * id : int <<PK>>
    --
    * habit_id : int <<FK ON DELETE CASCADE>>
    * date : datetime(6)
    * completed : boolean
  }
}
habits ||--o{ habit_completion_logs
note bottom
  Analytics & Reporting has no tables: the dashboard, the CSV and the PDF are
  computed on every request from these tables. The tables analytics_caches
  and word_clouds do not exist in the database.
end note
@enduml
